# Who must review what (WorkflowRunners_17, ReviewBot_17.8; RTM Review_01).
# GitHub applies the last line whose pattern matches a file, so the catch-all comes first and the
# narrower lines after it. The review bot reads the logins on the last `*` line as the code owners
# whose replies in a pull request's conversation may grant an exception to a rubric item; a team or
# an email there fails the review by name. The review bot is never a code owner.

*                       @ryanlandvater

# The rules a pull request is judged by and the workflows that judge it: named explicitly so that a
# later, narrower owner line cannot take them from the maintainer. The bot sends CONTRIBUTING.md and
# development/ whole with every review (DevelopmentSplit_21).
/.github/review/        @ryanlandvater
/.github/workflows/     @ryanlandvater
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @ryanlandvater
/development/           @ryanlandvater
